+ Home ------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|A terminal UI for a Bitcoin Cash P2Poolv2 node and the BCHN it mines on.      |
|                                                                              |
|Node config              : not set                                            |
|Pick the node's config.toml in P2Pool Config or Settings. The API and BCHN are|
|read from it; its network (mainnet or chipnet) is the only switch.            |
|                                                                              |
|Up/Down picks a screen, Left/Right a tab, r refreshes, q quits.               |
|                                                                              |
|                                                                              |
|                                                                              |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
